OL,3,GNEWSAA9 closed in both directions at
OL,4,ADunkeld after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collision has forced the closure of
OL,7,Fthe A9 in both directions at Dunkeld.
OL,9,FEmergency services were alerted to the
OL,10,Fcrash at about 10:25.
OL,12,FPolice said diversions were being put
OL,13,Fin place and motorists were being
OL,14,Fadvised to take an alternative route.
OL,16,FAn air ambulance was seen flying over
OL,17,Fthe scene of the collision, but the was
OL,18,Fno immediate indication if there had
OL,19,Fbeen casualties.
